    REFACTOR-0003: the reports loop over MusicSource, not over each platform
    
    Each report parsed and looped over every platform itself, so adding a
    platform meant a new block in every report. MyWrapped now wraps each
    export in its adapter once, in the constructor, and each report loops
    over allPlays() once. The reports never parse, never see a
    platform-specific field name, and don't know which platform a play came
    from.
    
    The constructor still takes one export per platform and names every
    adapter, so adding a platform still changes MyWrapped.

